@baseUrl = https://localhost:7142

### ========================================
### ORDER ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

### Get Orders Paged
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/paged?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10

### Get Order By Id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1

### Get Order With Items (Details)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/details

### Get Orders By Customer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/customer/1

### Create Order (Customer 1, with 2 items)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 15000.00
    },
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 250.50
    }
  ]
}

### Create Another Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 3,
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 450.00
    }
  ]
}

### ========================================
### ORDER STATUS CHANGES
### ========================================

### Mark Order As Paid
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/pay

### Ship Order
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/ship

### Deliver Order
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/deliver

### Cancel Order
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/2/cancel

### Delete Order
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1
